# Material data read at runtime by default_materials.py. These are tracked
# (force-added past the rule above), but scikit-build-core copies the pyoomph
# package into the wheel with .gitignore applied, so without this exception the
# blanket *.csv rule silently dropped them from every published wheel and sdist.
